# Run artefacts, not source.
#
# out/    - captured contribution files; the real ones belong in data/captures/
# state/  - the attempt ledger, which is per-machine: it records which codes
#           this client has already imported, and a code can only be imported
#           once, so it must never be shared between rigs or reset by a merge.
# drag_timing.json - drag_tuner.js's scratch overrides for drag.js TIMING.
#           Local and temporary: once the numbers hold they get written into
#           drag.js as the new defaults in an ordinary commit and this deleted.
out/
state/
drag_timing.json
